---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="pepprime | Refund Policy" description="Refund policy for pepprime website.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 prose-policy">
    <div class="label-pill">Policy</div>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4">Effective date: [Insert date]</p>
    <p>pepprime aims to provide clear communication and professional support for every order inquiry.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Order Review</h2>
    <p>Please confirm product name, strength, quantity, and destination details carefully before payment or shipment discussion.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Refund Eligibility</h2>
    <p>Refunds may be considered only in limited situations, including verified internal processing error, confirmed incorrect item, or another issue accepted after review.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Non-Refundable Situations</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Change of mind after order confirmation</li>
      <li>Incorrect details provided by the customer</li>
      <li>Customs or courier delays outside our control</li>
      <li>Improper storage or handling after delivery</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Issue Reporting</h2>
    <p>If there is a confirmed delivery or item issue, contact us promptly with order details, photos, and a short explanation.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
